-Kamangha-manghang. Nandito na tayo.

377
00:22:22.591 --> 00:22:23.592
Kaya ito na.

378
00:22:23.675 --> 00:22:27.054
Napaisip ako kung ano ang ginagawa namin.

379
00:22:28.847 --> 00:22:30.223
Oh my goodness.

380
00:22:30.724 --> 00:22:32.100
