396
00:23:22.776 --> 00:23:23.610
-Oo.
-Oo.

397
00:23:24.236 --> 00:23:26.530
Naramdaman kong pumasok ako
Pirates of the Caribbean.

398
00:23:26.613 --> 00:23:28.907
Ito ay tulad ng isang aktwal na shipwreck.

399
00:23:28.990 --> 00:23:30.700
Alam mo, ito ay hindi totoo.

400
00:23:32.828 --> 00:23:36.039
Hindi pa ako nakakita ng ganitong epic set.

401
00:23:36.123 --> 00:23:37.499
Napahanga ako.

402
00:23:37.582 --> 00:23:39.000
YOSHIO ITOI
Dating NATIONAL TEAM BASEBALL PLAYER

403
